# Only disposable outputs. Never ignore all of build/.
/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
/build/site/
/build/wiki-stage/
/build/*/.tmp/
/build/*/candidate/
/build/*/runtime/
/build/*/spec.md
/build/*/source-map.json
/build/*/inputs.lock.json
/build/*/contracts/
# plan.md, tests.md, tasks.md, execution-contract.yaml, and accepted/ remain tracked.
# Sanitized accepted/receipts are durable; runtime/ contains only disposable private logs.
